  "articleBody": "A successful kitchen storage remodel begins with an inventory of what you own, measurements of the existing room, and a clear list of daily frustrations. Then a remodeling team can test layout options, assign storage by task, select cabinet accessories, coordinate countertop and utility changes, and confirm the construction scope. The finished plan should make common items easy to reach without overcrowding work areas.",
